{"question_id":"e06_q01","tenant_id":"b99ee77f-debe-4341-a9ed-0e48f031ca4a","video_id":"4cfb6540-0bbb-4cd2-ab23-87969a61f162","video_title":"v-21","question":"把所有代数余子式排成伴随矩阵时，为何可以概括为“按行算、按列放”？","answer":"先逐行求原矩阵各元素的代数余子式，再把每一行算出的结果作为伴随矩阵的一列，即对代数余子式矩阵转置。","tags":["reasoning","math","definition"],"gold_evidence_groups":[["cce9fc51-3edf-4db5-a3c7-aad19b2cfaf3","aac8dfab-3bf9-40b5-a46f-0663f1400880"]]}
{"question_id":"e06_q02","tenant_id":"b99ee77f-debe-4341-a9ed-0e48f031ca4a","video_id":"4cfb6540-0bbb-4cd2-ab23-87969a61f162","video_title":"v-21","question":"为什么一个非方阵不能照样套用伴随矩阵的定义？","answer":"伴随矩阵依赖每个元素对应的方阵余子式以及最终同阶排列，因此只对方阵定义，非方阵没有伴随矩阵。","tags":["reasoning","math","definition"],"gold_evidence_groups":[["7658dbf8-3f94-493f-bff0-4abea499455a"]]}
{"question_id":"e06_q03","tenant_id":"b99ee77f-debe-4341-a9ed-0e48f031ca4a","video_id":"4cfb6540-0bbb-4cd2-ab23-87969a61f162","video_title":"v-21","question":"原方阵乘自己的伴随矩阵，无论左右相乘都会得到什么；结果中的对角与非对角位置分别是什么？","answer":"AA*=A*A=|A|E；主对角线均为 |A|，非主对角线均为 0。","tags":["reasoning","math"],"gold_evidence_groups":[["aca770c7-8636-4420-ba21-c0e25aa5ef85"]]}
{"question_id":"e06_q04","tenant_id":"b99ee77f-debe-4341-a9ed-0e48f031ca4a","video_id":"4cfb6540-0bbb-4cd2-ab23-87969a61f162","video_title":"v-21","question":"上一个乘积恒等式为什么不需要先假设 A 可逆？请分别解释非零和交叉位置的来源。","answer":"它直接来自行列式展开而非求逆：本行元素配本行代数余子式得到 |A|，配另一行的代数余子式会构造出两行相同的行列式而为 0，所以奇异矩阵也成立。","tags":["reasoning","multi_evidence","proof"],"gold_evidence_groups":[["0fcc6040-a329-42d3-ae91-f1ff62aebb95"],["21122bbb-445c-4fe1-8d13-718eca1d73ed"],["fbd1d5fb-f073-4d32-b1e4-6372709f51f5"]]}
{"question_id":"e06_q05","tenant_id":"b99ee77f-debe-4341-a9ed-0e48f031ca4a","video_id":"4cfb6540-0bbb-4cd2-ab23-87969a61f162","video_title":"v-21","question":"对 AA*=|A|E 两边取行列式后，怎样得到伴随矩阵行列式的幂次关系；A 奇异时是否例外？","answer":"得到 |A|·|A*|=|A|^n，从而 |A*|=|A|^(n-1)；当 |A|=0 时两边仍为 0，因此结论也成立。","tags":["reasoning","proof","math"],"gold_evidence_groups":[["9a83dc16-2fe5-4c9a-9ca9-cef102473a5a"],["d92ad982-855f-44ba-b87f-e79f81108384"]]}
{"question_id":"e06_q06","tenant_id":"b99ee77f-debe-4341-a9ed-0e48f031ca4a","video_id":"4cfb6540-0bbb-4cd2-ab23-87969a61f162","video_title":"v-21","question":"转置与求伴随交换顺序会怎样；把整个 n 阶矩阵乘 k 后再求伴随，又会多出几次 k？","answer":"(A^T)*=(A*)^T；(kA)*=k^(n-1)A*。","tags":["comparison","multi_evidence","math"],"gold_evidence_groups":[["2b0e14fe-3e94-47fd-a3cb-c1abacd998a5"]]}
{"question_id":"e06_q07","tenant_id":"b99ee77f-debe-4341-a9ed-0e48f031ca4a","video_id":"4cfb6540-0bbb-4cd2-ab23-87969a61f162","video_title":"v-21","question":"二阶情形有哪些可心算的换位和变号规则，它为什么不宜直接推广到三阶？","answer":"主对角线两项互换，副对角线位置不动但取相反数；三阶余子式已是二阶行列式，没有同样的简单换位规则。","tags":["reasoning","math","method"],"gold_evidence_groups":[["534d0f06-49ae-45b8-a774-f1d09e8e0be6"]]}
{"question_id":"e06_q08","tenant_id":"b99ee77f-debe-4341-a9ed-0e48f031ca4a","video_id":"4cfb6540-0bbb-4cd2-ab23-87969a61f162","video_title":"v-21","question":"例 6 中 A*=A^T 且第一行三个元素相等为正，为什么最后能确定 a11，而不是只得到一个比例？结果是多少？","answer":"由两边取行列式可得 |A|=1；又按第一行展开有 |A|=a11^2+a12^2+a13^2=3a11^2，因此 a11=√3/3。","tags":["reasoning","multi_evidence","math"],"gold_evidence_groups":[["49aa0d6c-1207-41a5-b557-6cdf8f19fd73"],["fa67344e-913e-45ee-a7a9-663bddf63320"]]}
