{"question_id":"e07_q02","tenant_id":"b99ee77f-debe-4341-a9ed-0e48f031ca4a","video_id":"9a24831b-b538-4328-a3f2-5f19c70592b7","video_title":"v-22","question":"在第 i 个逻辑位置插入时，搬家为何必须从表尾方向开始；真正赋值的数组位置又为何少 1？","answer":"若从前往后后移会覆盖尚未搬走的数据，所以应从后向前移动；位序从 1 开始而下标从 0 开始，新元素写入 data[i-1]。","tags":["reasoning","multi_evidence","data_structure"],"gold_evidence_groups":[["10cf376c-0a7f-4137-a3bf-1d8a9b84730b"],["50793d14-4669-4a88-968c-a2ce7f8d0b5f"]]}
{"question_id":"e07_q03","tenant_id":"b99ee77f-debe-4341-a9ed-0e48f031ca4a","video_id":"9a24831b-b538-4328-a3f2-5f19c70592b7","video_title":"v-22","question":"一个健壮的插入接口在移动数据前需要拒绝哪两类请求？","answer":"要拒绝 i 不在 1 到 length+1 之间的非法位序，以及 length 已达到 MaxSize 的满表插入。","tags":["reasoning","code_quality"],"gold_evidence_groups":[["95787da3-247f-4905-ba87-dc986a018b01"]]}
